<title>POLAND: NOVITA 96 NET RISES TO PLN 4 MLN.</title>
<headline>NOVITA 96 NET RISES TO PLN 4 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results December</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>DECEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.15 vs   1.43 loss</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.20 vs   1.04 loss</p>
<p> Operating loss	 1.11 vs   0.24</p>
